sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant TS as Ticket Service
  participant PG as PostgreSQL
  participant Worker as Outbox Worker
  participant MQ as RabbitMQ
  participant NS as Notification Service
  participant Mongo as MongoDB
  participant AS as Analytics Service

  Note over TS,PG: Ticket transaction committed
  loop Every 2 seconds
    Worker->>PG: Poll pending outbox rows
    PG-->>Worker: eventId and payload
  end
  Worker->>MQ: Publish persistent ticket.status_changed event
  MQ-->>Worker: Publisher confirm
  par Notification delivery at least once
    MQ->>NS: Deliver notification queue event
    NS->>Mongo: Upsert notification by eventId
    Mongo-->>NS: Stored or already exists
    NS-->>MQ: ACK after MongoDB write
  and Analytics delivery at least once
    MQ->>AS: Deliver analytics queue event
    AS->>PG: Write analytics PostgreSQL projection
    PG-->>AS: Projection stored
    AS-->>MQ: ACK after projection write
  end
  Note over Worker,MQ: Retry after broker recovery
  Note over NS,AS: Deduplicate by eventId
